  "notes": "Base images are immutable once any account references them. They live in the external data dir (images_dir; Windows C:/Users/berat/OmniImages, Linux ~/OmniImages) and are NEVER committed. base_x86 + base_arm are the two canonical bases; the host architecture selects between them.",
